{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45177","headline":"同李司直题武丘寺兼留诸公与陆羽之无锡 · 皎然","name":"同李司直题武丘寺兼留诸公与陆羽之无锡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陵寝成香阜，禅枝出白杨。\n劒池留故事，月树即他方。\n应世缘须别，栖心趣不忘。\n还将陆居士，晨发泛归航。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45177.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45177","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}